<title>USA: Champion International sets $200 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Champion International sets $200 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Champion International Corp was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHAMPION INTERNATIONAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2026</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.943  FIRST PAY DATE 05/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.206 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +85 BP     PUTABLE IN 15TH YEAR</p>
<p>PRICED OVER U.S. TREASURY 10-YEAR NOTES</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
